SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Lgbtq
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerCelebrate community\, creativi
 ty\, and Asian American and Pacific Islander cultures at the 2026 Many Moo
 ns Festival\, presented by AAPIC North Bay. This welcoming\, family-friend
 ly festival brings together live entertainment\, cultural performances and
  demonstrations\, food and beverages\, artists\, makers and marketplace ve
 ndors\, wellness and community organizations\, and interactive activities 
 for children and teens. Festivalgoers can also experience the Under Many M
 oons art exhibit and connect with the diverse people\, traditions\, and st
 ories that make the North Bay vibrant.\n\nMany Moons Festival takes place 
 Saturday\, October 3\, 2026\, from 11:00 a.m. to 7:00 p.m. at Ives Park in
  Sebastopol\, California. Advance tickets are $10\; admission is $15 at th
 e gate\; children 12 and under attend free. For the latest schedule\, tick
 et information\, transportation details\, accessibility information\, and 
 festival updates\, visit manymoonsfestival.com.\n\n$10.00\n\nTickets: http
 s://manymoonsfestival.com\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/moons-festival
 -2026-aapi-culture-food-art-sebastopol/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/MMF202
 6_Landscape_1200x628.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:Ives Park\, 7400 Willow St
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/moons-festival-2026-aapi-culture-food-art-seba
 stopol/
