DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerBota Tapas and Paella BarBota 
 Tapas & Paella Bar near Downtown San Francisco and Union Square is doing 
 “Tapas Tuesdays” and enjoy all of our delicious Spanish Tapas at 10% O
 ff. Just mention “Tapas Tuesday” to our server before ordering to get 
 the discount.\nAbout Bota Tapas and Paella Bar\n\nAs an age-old tradition 
 dating back to the early 1800s\, Spanish travelers used “BOTA”\, or tr
 aditional sheep-skinned repositories\, to transport and share their wine. 
 The Spaniards historically thrived on the values of sharing and community:
  two ideals that have buoyantly withstood the test of time. Tailored aroun
 d these same ideals are Spain’s cuisine and the development of “tapas\
 ,” style dining – where individuals share small plates and memories. F
 rom Seville to San Francisco\, and across the world\, our goal is to initi
 ate more memories – this is why and how we operate. Whether it be with y
 our friends or family\, we here at Bota sincerely hope that you enjoy this
  stop on your journey.\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.botasf.com/\nDetail
 s: https://sf.funcheap.com/tapas-tuesday-10-spanish-small-plates-union-squ
 are/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Patata
 s-and-Ox-Tail.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:Bota Tapas and Paella Bar\, 490 Geary Street\, San Francisco\, CA
  94102
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/tapas-tuesday-10-spanish-small-plates-union-sq
 uare/
END:VEVENT
