BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Man Power. 25 Years of Roam
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261009T210000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261009T230000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001200Z
UID:dothebay-17807130@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:DJ/Parties
DESCRIPTION:Roam x Sirens presents a night in San Francisco marking twenty
  five years of Roam Recordings\, alongside the release of the label's anni
 versary compilation\, 25 Years of Roam. Man Power headlines.\n\nMan Power 
 (Me Me Me / Correspondant\, UK) is a producer and DJ from the North East o
 f England\, more than a decade deep into a career built on the trust of a 
 scene that doesn't hand that out easily. Labels like DFA\, Rekids\, and Hi
 vern Discs put his records out because they know he doesn't play safe\, an
 d neither does his DJing\, and his recent run of collaborations with Juan 
 Maclean under the name Juan Power only sharpens that reputation further. E
 very set he plays is assembled in the moment\, pulled from a mind that jum
 ps between disco\, Italo\, house\, and techno without warning\, which mean
 s what happens on the night only happens once. There's no replaying it\, n
 o catching the same set twice. That's the reason people who've followed hi
 m for years still show up early and stay to the end\, and why a room that 
 trusts him goes all in the second he steps behind the decks.\n\nHe's joine
 d by Shiny Objects (Om Records) and from Roam Recordings: Jason Peters and
  Chad Mitchell.\n\nRoam x Sirens\n\nTickets: https://ra.co/events/2526521\
 nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/9/man-power-25-years-of-roam
 -tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/34258560/5fa01b59-49a9-46a0-883b-cfd5cd81dcf1.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001200Z
LOCATION:Public Works Loft\, 161 Erie St\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94103
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/9/man-power-25-years-of-roam-ticke
 ts
END:VEVENT
