 ber the Time — expect all the classics you know by heart\, plus deep cut
 s for the real MJ fans.ALL NIGHT LONG:• Nonstop Michael Jackson hits\, d
 eep cuts & music videos• Midnight Michael Lookalike Contest hosted by Mi
 a Munro — come dressed to impress!• Photo ops• Halloween décor• S
 urprises throughout the nightWhether you’re BAD\, DANGEROUS\, or just wa
 nt to SCREAM\, this is your night to hit the dance floor and show us the w
