 10 with a dash of music from his throwback contemporaries like Prince\, Ma
 donna\, Janet Jackson\, Whitney Houston\, Earth Wind & Fire\, and more! An
 d at 10:30 PM the show starts with 3.5 hours of NON STOP MICHAEL! 🎶 DJ 
 Mr. Washington spinning ONLY Michael Jackson music & videos from 10:30 PM 
 -2AM!📍 QBa...\n\n$7.18\n\nTickets: https://www.eventbrite.com/e/thrille
 r-the-michael-jackson-dance-party-in-the-heart-of-the-castro-tickets-20003
