 \n8:00-11:00 PM - Social dancing with top DJs spinning the\nhottest Bachat
 a hits.\n\nEnjoy a night of great music\, community\, and movement - plus\
 ndelicious food\, craft cocktails\, wine\, beer\, and fine cigars availabl
 e for\npurchase.\n\nPricing:\nWe recommend registering online to reserve y
 our spot. Come\nearly\, grab a bite\, and make a night of it.\n\nAbout Jos
 e Santamaria:\nJose Santamaria has been a professional dance instructor an
 d\nchoreographer for more than 20 years. He has worked with leading instru
 ctors\nand traveled throughout the United States and internationally to re
 search Latin\ndance techniques.\n\nHis experience has helped him develop a
  diverse and\nversatile range of teaching strategies for individual dancer
 s and group\nperformers.\n\nNO REFUNDS - Must be 21+\n\n$8 online\, $10 at
  the door\nCigar Bar & Grill PRESENTS:\n\nTickets: https://www.cigarbarand
 grill.com/index.php/entertainment\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/20
